      "id": "claim_a19636cf1bc643058cc7f44ba3b38eab",
      "statement": "InterestScoringSweep runs on a @Scheduled fixedDelay of myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay (default PT2M) after an initial delay of myfeeder.interest.sweep-initial-delay (default PT1M), and each run enqueues min(scoringQueue.remainingCapacity(), sweepBatchSize) eligible article ids (default batch size 50), newest first by COALESCE(published_at, fetched_at) then id.",
