    {
      "id": "claim_a8fb59ef1d964401b702f364d35892e2",
      "statement": "New articles reach the scoring queue via FeedPollingService publishing ArticlesIngestedEvent, consumed by InterestScoringListener as a @TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT, fallbackExecution=true) that calls ScoringQueue.submitIngested after filtering ids through the same eligibility predicate the sweep uses; the listener never throws, swallowing and logging any failure so scoring never affects feed-poll error bookkeeping.",
