    {
      "id": "claim_1ad479ff3a284f12af3e2dae4230156c",
      "statement": "ScoringQueue tracks in-flight article ids in a ConcurrentHashSet to avoid double-submission, and when the executor throws TaskRejectedException on a full queue it immediately releases the id from the in-flight set so the sweep can retry it later; the queue itself never blocks or throws back to its callers.",
      "evidence": [
