      "statement": "ArticleScoringService.score runs with no database transaction spanning the Jev HTTP call, re-checks Jev-configured and cold-start status, re-verifies eligibility via ArticleScoreStore.loadCandidate at dispatch time, and writes a terminal SKIPPED row (never retried) when the article has no GUID or no judgeable text.",
